  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 66ca270a9c5bfc54492cc14d252c3e4e, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 66ca270a9c5bfc54492cc14d252c3e4e, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - Nemean Lion
  - "A,\nJust finished up at Stations 5 and 6 in northern Minnesota. The Gunflint
    Trail is beautiful\u2014wish you were here. Six down, six to go, and then I\u2019ll
    get back to you.\n\nDid you know that Hercules' first task was to kill the Nemean
    lion? It was supposed to be unkillable but he pulled it off. That story\u2019s
    been stuck in my head. Everything feels impossible right now. You\u2019ve seen
    my notes, so you know why Leo\u2019s on my mind. I just hope we can figure this
    out in time.\n\nEveryone in Duluth was talking about you\u2014like, \u201CWait,
    who\u2019s this girl mapping the sky?\u201D  Your dad\u2019s not thrilled with
    me, but he\u2019ll come around. He always does.\n\nI like you a LOT,\n   Elijah"
